cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "tdfextractor: Extract MS2, MGF, and mzML files from Bruker timsTOF .d folders"
abstract: >-
  tdfextractor reads Bruker timsTOF .d folders (DDA, DIA, and PRM
  acquisitions) via tdfpy and writes MS2, MGF, and mzML spectrum files for
  downstream search engines and processing pipelines. It supports
  precursor filtering by intensity, charge, m/z, retention time, CCS, and
  neutral mass, configurable peak centroiding and noise filtering, and
  per-array compression and encoding for mzML output. It requires Python
  3.12 or later.
version: "0.4.2"
